	)
	(text "1.5 mm SMD pads, no parts fitted. Each pad sits on its net (a probe point, never in series), in three labelled clusters on the PCB: signals coming in from the car, signals Icarus drives out, and internal measurement nodes. Each cluster has its own GND pad for the scope ground. Torque-line pads are for the bench; don't probe VT3/VT6 while driving."
